message: "If you use this lock, cite The Kartekeya Isolation Lock (E47-v1.0) and the exact commit SHA."
title: "The Kartekeya Isolation Lock: Finite Spectral Isolation of E47 = ker((C-6I)(C-30I)) with 29-Unit Intertwiner Algebra A_inv ≅ M5 ⊕ M2 at Ω_c = 47/125"
short-title: "The Kartekeya Isolation Lock"
version: "E47-v1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
type: software
license: "CC0-1.0"
