    description: "Immutable release branch E47-v1.0"
abstract: >-
  Finite first-principles lock of the KKP-R E47 kernel. On the carrier
  H = V2⊗3 (dim 125) the Casimir pencil K = (C-6I)(C-30I) isolates
  E47 = ker(K) = E6 ⊕ E30 with dim 47 and attractor Ω_c = 47/125.
